From bde4494f4935a51e851ddf901ede68805f4cb4a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:55:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(update): use fork GitHub releases

Fetch and verify fork release binaries and prevent package-managed installations from updating back to upstream. Preserve standalone update rollback and use fork-aware version ordering.

Validated with 31 focused updater tests and coding-agent type checking; release integration remains to be exercised.
